id: pm-slack-standup-52od
title: Enable GitHub CodeQL code scanning
description: "Add .github/workflows/codeql.yml (javascript-typescript, build-mode none, weekly staggered schedule). GET code-scanning/alerts returned 404 no-analysis-found, so the Security tab could not distinguish clean from never-ran. Advisory check only, not added to branch protection."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-08-22T18:01:59.324Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-22T11:15:56.746Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-21T19:09:14.121Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-21T19:09:14.121Z"
author: "harness:ox-alpha"
release: 2026.10.21
comments[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T19:07:46.128Z",codex-agent,"author=codex-agent,\"text=Authorized tracker reconciliation, audit 2026-10-21. Reverified current main 765b440ce656: CodeQL workflow retained; source tree exactly matches the audited snapshot. **Enable GitHub CodeQL code scanning.** .github/workflows/codeql.yml is present on main and registers code scanning. The request to enable the workflow is delivered; this is not a whole-package security certification.\""
notes[1]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-08-22T18:02:15.740Z","harness:ox-alpha","Verified 2026-08-22: gh api repos/unbraind/pm-slack-standup/code-scanning/alerts -> 404 'no analysis found'. Workflow SHA-pins github/codeql-action db488dde (v4.37.8) matching this repo's full-SHA pinning convention; permissions limited to security-events:write/actions:read/contents:read."
files[1]{path,scope,note}:
  .github/workflows/codeql.yml,project,CodeQL scanning workflow - javascript-typescript build-mode none weekly staggered cron
tests[2]:
  - command: gh run list -R unbraind/pm-slack-standup --branch ci/enable-codeql-scanning
    scope: project
    note: CodeQL workflow run succeeds on the PR branch
  - command: gh api repos/unbraind/pm-slack-standup/code-scanning/alerts
    scope: project
    assert_stdout_regex[1]: rule_id|most_recent_instance|analysis_key
    note: code-scanning alerts endpoint returns an analysis instead of 404 no-analysis-found
close_reason: "Reverified current main 765b440ce656: CodeQL workflow retained; source tree exactly matches the audited snapshot. **Enable GitHub CodeQL code scanning.** .github/workflows/codeql.yml is present on main and registers code scanning. The request to enable the workflow is delivered; this is not a whole-package security certification."
